# Access chain constraint generation: multi-field accumulation
# Multiple dot-accesses on the same forward-referenced dict should accumulate constraints.
# Tests that constraint generation handles multiple fields correctly.
[first_name: $data.first
 last_name: $data.last
 age_plus_one: [call $+ $data.age 1]
 data: [first: Alice  last: Smith  age: 30]]
===
Dict({"first_name": String("Alice"), "last_name": String("Smith"), "age_plus_one": Int(31), "data": Dict({"first": String("Alice"), "last": String("Smith"), "age": Int(30)})})
